{
  "declaredLength": 4200,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "嗶啪！？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55F6556AFF01FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "胡帕你怎麼了？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n是<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā他她帶著什麼\n讓你好奇的東西嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "80E15E154F60600E9EBC4E86FF1F00100001BE01000A662F001000020100000000100003110000FF01014ED659795E3684574EC09EBC000A8B934F60597D594776846771897F55CEFF1F00100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀……\n那個糖果是？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE544020262026000A90A3500B7CD6679C662FFF1F00100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "劈哩啪啦糖果",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "528854E9556A55667CD6679C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "想吃一口嗎？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60F354034E0053E355CEFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "竟然會在嘴裡劈哩啪啦跳，\n聽起來有點恐怖，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n但嚐一嚐，應該能學到新東西。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7ADF713667035728563488E1528854E9556A55668DF3FF0C000A807D8D774F8667099EDE60506016FF0C00100001BE00000A4F4656904E005690FF0C61C98A7280FD5B78523065B06771897F300200100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我就不客氣了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115C314E0D5BA26C234E86300200100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE5440FF0100100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我有預感，\n很棒的甜甜圈就要誕生了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621167099810611FFF0C000A5F8868D27684751C751C57085C3189818A95751F4E86300200100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n請稍等一下。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A8ACB7A0D7B494E004E0B300200100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "完成了！\n這是新甜甜圈的食譜。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B8C62104E86FF01000A9019662F65B0751C751C5708768498DF8B5C300200100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "製作時請按照甜：40以上，\n辣：200以上，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n酸：400以上，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n苦：280以上，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n鮮：40以上來製作。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "88FD4F5C66428ACB63097167751CFF1A003400304EE54E0AFF0C000A8FA3FF1A0032003000304EE54E0AFF0C00100001BE00000A9178FF1A0034003000304EE54E0AFF0C00100001BE00000A82E6FF1A0032003800304EE54E0AFF0C00100001BE00000A9BAEFF1A003400304EE54E0A4F8688FD4F5C300200100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果要製作新的甜甜圈，\n請告訴我一聲喔！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C898188FD4F5C65B07684751C751C5708FF0C000A8ACB544A8A3462114E0080725594FF0100100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "靈感來自劈哩啪啦糖果的\n刺激的<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>等離子閃電甜甜圈<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>完成了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9748611F4F8681EA528854E9556A55667CD6679C7684000A523A6FC0768400100002FF0000067B4996E25B50958396FB751C751C570800100002FF0000005B8C62104E86FF0100100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "讓胡帕吃下後，不知道\n能前往什麼樣的異次元密阿雷呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B9380E15E1554034E0B5F8CFF0C4E0D77E59053000A80FD524D5F804EC09EBC6A23768475706B2151435BC6963F96F75462300200100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "緊急呼叫！\n快到<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>密阿雷南站前<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>來喔！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7DCA6025547C53EBFF01000A5FEB523000100002FF0000065BC6963F96F753577AD9524D00100002FF0000004F865594FF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "似乎又要發生棘手的大事了，\n但有<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳在，一定沒問題的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F3C4E4E53C88981767C751F68D8624B768459274E8B4E86FF0C000A4F466709001000020100000000100003110000FF01014F6059B35728FF0C4E005B9A6C92554F984C7684FF0100100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳看。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B3770B300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這是個連<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳也沒見過的\n異次元扭洞吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9019662F500B902300100003110000FF01014F6059B34E5F6C92898B904E7684000A75706B215143626D6D1E5427FF1F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "第一次見到呢",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B2C4E006B21898B523054620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是黃色的耶",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F9EC38272768480360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不知道裡面會有什麼樣的寶可夢，\n所以我把<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳找來了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D77E5905388E19762670367094EC09EBC6A2376845BF653EF5922FF0C000A62404EE56211628A00100003110000FF01014F6059B3627E4F864E86300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "現在可以接個委託嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "73FE572853EF4EE563A5500B59D48A1755CEFF1F00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我們偵測到了很誇張的扭洞！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n裡面應該會有不得了的寶可夢，\n要是牠失控超級進化可就大事不妙啦。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n就照老樣子，拜託你們3個去調查一下吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我會去通知\n超級進化的大姐和隊長的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211670353BB901A77E5000A8D857D1A903253167684592759D0548C968A95777684300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對了，地點在<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>密阿雷南站前<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>喔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D4E86FF0C57309EDE572800100002FF0000065BC6963F96F753577AD9524D00100002FF0000005594300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我正在那裡",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62116B63572890A388E10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我已經知道在哪裡了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115DF27D9377E59053572854EA88E14E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳這傢伙果真有意思！\n好啦，這事就拜託了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B3901950A24F19679C771F6709610F601DFF01000A597D5566FF0C90194E8B5C3162DC8A174E86300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "烏羽他啊，\n或許是塊當市長之類的料呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70CF7FBD4ED6554AFF0C000A62168A31662F584A75765E0295774E4B985E768465995462300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可爾妮在此登場！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EF723E59AE57286B64767B5834FF0100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001>說<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā她他暫時趕不過來。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A00100002018B00018AAA00100003110000FF010159794ED666AB66428D954E0D904E4F86300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以就由我們兩個去挑戰吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE55C317531621150115169500B53BB631162305427300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可爾妮，\n我可以幫忙代打喔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EF723E59AEFF0C000A621153EF4EE55E6B5FD94EE362535594300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "瑪琪艾兒！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "746A742A827E5152FF0100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "超級甜甜圈大作戰之前，\n我們在異次元密阿雷碰過面。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D857D1A751C751C570859274F5C62304E4B524DFF0C000A62115011572875706B2151435BC6963F96F778B0904E9762300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "瑪琪艾兒妳也是個\n厲害的超級進化行家對不對?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "746A742A827E515259B34E5F662F500B000A53B25BB376848D857D1A90325316884C5BB65C0D4E0D5C0D003F00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就這麼決定了～！\n這次就由我們3個去挑戰吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C3190199EBC6C7A5B9A4E86FF5EFF01000A90196B215C317531621150110033500B53BB631162305427FF0100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n準備好了就告訴我一聲。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A6E965099597D4E865C31544A8A3462114E008072300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿*",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要進去嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981903253BB55CEFF1F00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "進入異次元密阿雷",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9032516575706B2151435BC6963F96F70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "先做準備",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 2632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5148505A6E9650990000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我們3個是第一次搭配，\n準備得仔細點準沒錯的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 2644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621150110033500B662F7B2C4E006B21642D914DFF0C000A6E9650995F974ED47D309EDE6E966C92932F7684300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我隨時都沒問題！\n畢竟這是為了守護密阿雷的和平。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 2700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621196A8664290FD6C92554F984CFF01000A75627ADF9019662F70BA4E865B888B775BC6963F96F77684548C5E73300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，等一下！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的盒子是滿的，\n這樣怎麼捉寶可夢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 2760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C7B494E004E0BFF0100100001BE01000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B3768476D25B50662F6EFF7684FF0C000A90196A23600E9EBC63495BF653EF5922300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是個偵探，所以我知道喔。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n想去特別的異次元密阿雷，\n必須要有特別的甜甜圈對不對！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 2844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211662F500B507563A2FF0C62404EE5621177E590535594300200100001BE01000A60F353BB72795225768475706B2151435BC6963F96F7FF0C000A5FC5980889816709727952257684751C751C57085C0D4E0D5C0DFF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿2",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 2944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00320000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "捷拉奧拉！？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 2956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "637762C9596762C9FF01FF1F00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "最強的電屬性寶可夢……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n要是牠失控超級進化了，\n後果實在是無法想像。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 2980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67005F37768496FB5C6C60275BF653EF59222026202600100001BE01000A8981662F7260593163A78D857D1A903253164E86FF0C000A5F8C679C5BE65728662F71216CD560F350CF300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就連可爾妮妳這樣的訓練家，\n也會感到牠的威脅嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 3064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C31902353EF723E59AE59B390196A2376848A137DF45BB6FF0C000A4E5F6703611F5230726076845A01810555CEFF1F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "怎麼會。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 3124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "600E9EBC6703300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是高興得不得了。\n這下有機會和強敵交手了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 3144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211662F9AD882085F974E0D5F974E863002000A90194E0B67096A5F6703548C5F3765754EA4624B4E86FF0100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "當然，我會好好平息牠的失控超級進化，\n讓牠從痛苦解脫的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 3200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75767136FF0C62116703597D597D5E73606F72607684593163A78D857D1A90325316FF0C000A8B9372605F9E75DB82E689E3812B7684300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "周圍的超級能濃度\n急劇上升！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n警告！您確認到的個體\n即將失控超級進化！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 3268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5468570D76848D857D1A80FD6FC35EA6000A602552874E0A5347FF0100100001BE01000A8B66544AFF0160A878BA8A8D52307684500B9AD4000A53735C07593163A78D857D1A90325316FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 3348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF003A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嚎噢！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 3360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "568E5662FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n把捷拉奧拉捉起來吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 3368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A628A637762C9596762C963498D774F865427300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "捷拉奧拉，\n真是個無比強大的對手。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 3412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "637762C9596762C9FF0C000A771F662F500B71216BD45F37592776845C0D624B300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "捷拉奧拉有時會出現在街頭，\n就像是在尋找對戰的對手似的。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n有時還會當起保鏢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 3456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "637762C9596762C967096642670351FA73FE57288857982DFF0C000A5C3150CF662F57285C0B627E5C0D623076845C0D624B4F3C7684300200100001BE00000A670966429084670375768D774FDD93E2300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "說不定是牠那份追求強大的心，\n孕育出了這個異次元密阿雷。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 3548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8AAA4E0D5B9A662F726090A34EFD8FFD6C425F37592776845FC3FF0C000A5B5580B251FA4E869019500B75706B2151435BC6963F96F7300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼，我們回到\n熟悉的密阿雷去吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 3616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A39EBCFF0C6211501156DE5230000A719F608976845BC6963F96F753BB5427300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿A",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 3660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00410000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，還有可爾妮，\n原來<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳們是這樣在守護密阿雷的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 3672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C9084670953EF723E59AEFF0C000A539F4F8600100003110000FF01014F6059B35011662F90196A2357285B888B775BC6963F96F77684300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真的是辛苦<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳們了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 3748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F7684662F8F9B82E600100003110000FF01014F6059B350114E86FF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我們才該道謝呢～！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n要是沒有瑪琪艾兒妳，是沒辦法\n平息捷拉奧拉的失控超級進化的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 3788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115011624D8A7290538B1D5462FF5EFF0100100001BE01000A8981662F6C926709746A742A827E515259B3FF0C662F6C928FA66CD5000A5E73606F637762C9596762C97684593163A78D857D1A903253167684300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "抱歉！\n我來晚了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 3884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62B16B49FF01000A62114F86665A4E86300200100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對不起，\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳們等很久了吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 3912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D4E0D8D77FF0C000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B350117B495F884E454E865427FF1F00100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "已經結束囉。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 71,
      "offsetInSection": 3960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5DF27D937D50675F56C9300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "什麼？\n咦？瑪琪艾兒？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 72,
      "offsetInSection": 3984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EC09EBCFF1F000A54A6FF1F746A742A827E5152FF1F00100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "什麼？\n咦？瑪琪艾兒？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 73,
      "offsetInSection": 4016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EC09EBCFF1F000A54A6FF1F746A742A827E5152FF1F00100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我代替<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā妳你在異次元密阿雷\n奮戰了一番！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 74,
      "offsetInSection": 4048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114EE366FF00100003110000FF010159B34F60572875706B2151435BC6963F96F7000A596E62304E864E00756AFF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "今後最強的3人組就是\n我們這3個了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 75,
      "offsetInSection": 4108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4ECA5F8C67005F37768400334EBA7D445C31662F000A6211501190190033500B4E86300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "怎麼會那樣～！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 76,
      "offsetInSection": 4156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "600E9EBC670390A36A23FF5EFF0100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "什麼～！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 77,
      "offsetInSection": 4180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EC09EBCFF5EFF0100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    }
  ],
